    "Decisions locked in after the exploration round (see `subset_final_snakemake_exploration.ipynb`):\n",
    "\n",
    "| Modality | Embedding for clustering | Leiden res. | Notes |\n",
    "|----------|--------------------------|-------------|-------|\n",
    "| **HCG methylation** | SVD top-9 \u2192 **Harmony** | 0.6 | n_pc_graph=9, k=25 |\n",
    "| **Hi-C** | hicluster SVD top-10 \u2192 **Harmony** | 0.5 | n_pc_graph=10, k=25 |\n",
