    "## \u00a78.8 Per-modality UMAPs (Chen et al. 2026 Fig. 4b style)\n",
    "\n",
    "Four side-by-side UMAPs \u2014 HCG methylation, GCH accessibility, 3D Genome\n",
    "(Hi-C), Joint embedding \u2014 every cell colored by the cortex `cell_type`\n",
    "annotation from \u00a78. Single shared legend on the right. Mirrors Fig. 4b\n",
    "of Chen et al. *Gene regulatory landscape dissected by single-cell\n",
    "four-omics sequencing*."
